Key changes:

- Fail-closed classification of every runtime-root file.
- Added `.cxx`, `.hpp`, `.hh`, and `.hxx` coverage.
- Detects Foundation/Objective-C loaders, libcurl, C process APIs, Swift processes, and aliased/grouped Go download surfaces.
- Unknown files and policy/exclusion changes fail closed.
- Added exact-reason adversarial regressions and bounded the audit claim in [relay-supply-chain.md](/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/docs/relay-supply-chain.md).

Validation passed:

- 17 supply-chain tests
- 26 asset-manifest tests
- 4 Swift manifest tests
- All relay Go tests, 35 release tests, and Go vet
- Unsigned `swift build`
- Formatting, lint, JSON, privacy, and diff checks
- Byte-identical double generation

`task-board handoff` exited 0; status is `to-review`, checklist 13/13. The known parent aggregate mismatch remains recorded and validation was not weakened.
