-Go `_test.go` files are explicitly excluded because they are test tooling, not
-application runtime inputs; `scripts/` is likewise outside the declared
-runtime roots. Foundation network loaders, ambiguous `Data(contentsOf:)`
-loads, process/shell execution, Go network/process/plugin imports and calls,
-download commands, and HTTP locators are rejected. The only source-level
